    "chunk_text": "\u00fe\u00e6t man weor\u00feige h\u00e6\u00f0ene godas & sunnan Manslagan & manswaran, hadbrecan & \u00e6wbrecan gebugan & gebetan, o\u00f0\u00f0e of cy\u00f0\u00f0e mid synnan Licceteras & leogeras, ryperas & reaferas Godes graman habban, butan hig geswican & \u00fee deoppar & se \u00f0e eard wylle rihtlice cl\u00e6nsian & unriht alecgan & rihtwisnesse lufian, \u00feonne mot he georne Uton eac ealle ymbe fri\u00f0es bote & feos bote smeagan swy\u00f0e georne: swa embe fri\u00f0es bote, swa \u00f0am And se \u00f0e ofer \u00feis fals wyrce, \u00feolige \u00fe\u00e6ra handa, \u00fee he \u00fe\u00e6t fals mid worhte; & he hi mid nanon \u00feingon And gyf man \u00feonne \u00fe\u00e6ne gerefan teo, \u00fe\u00e6t he be his leafe \u00fe\u00e6t fals worhte, ladige hine mid \u00feryfealdre And gemeta & gewihta rihte man georne & \u00e6lces unrihtes heonon for\u00f0 geswice. & burhbota & bricbota & scipfor\u00f0unga aginne man georne, & fyrdunga eac swa, a \u00fe\u00e6nne \u00feearf si for And smeage man symle on \u00e6ghwylce wisan, hu man fyrmest m\u00e6ge r\u00e6d aredian \u00feeode to \u00feearfe & For\u00f0am \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6t hit sceal on earde godian to ahte, \u00fe\u00e6t man unriht alecge & rihtwisnesse lufige for \u00d0is syndon \u00fea gerihta, \u00fee se cingc ah ofer ealle men on Wessexan: \u00fe\u00e6t is mundbryce & hamsocne, & se \u00f0e utlages weorc gewyrce, wealde se cingc \u00fe\u00e6s fri\u00fees. And gyf he bocland h\u00e6bbe",
